### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanRoundaboutWithMovingVehicle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle moving unexpectedly into roundabout" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Debris or object on road surface near roundabout" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear weather with no precipitation or fog" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle intruding into roundabout path, potentially causing collision" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Debris/object partially obscuring roundabout markings, increasing collision risk" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .
```

